  "_about": "Icon inventory of the PhonoTrainer Android client. Every glyph is a Lucide icon (lucide.dev, v1.51.0, the version the web client uses; ISC, with Feather-derived glyphs under MIT), drawn on a 24 x 24 grid with round caps and joins. stroke is in viewport units: 2 for UI glyphs, 2.25 for the family and practice glyphs (the web's FamilyIcon weight). Every icon is shown next to a word or carries a content description; none is the only cue. Export: tools/lucide_icons.py writes the SVG sources, tools/svg2vd.py the VectorDrawables (24 dp, #FF000000, tinted at runtime).",
